[{"title":"示儿","author":"洪钺","text":"豫章实佳木，寻丈早异众。\n匠石虽未顾，终解作梁栋。\n社栎大蔽牛，不资世所用。\n弃置成散材，岁久即空洞。\n诚由天所产，亦在德者种。\n吾儿豫章流，丱角不好弄。\n经训虽未通，数过辄成诵。\n只今十五六，举止颇持重。\n仰赖师友功，缀缉成赋颂。\n积丝未盈尺，粗喜入机综。\n胡为不自量，将使应乡贡。\n文场倍千数，作者岂倖中。\n而子于其间，燕雀杂鸾凤。\n铅刀未易割，庶可供一鬨。\n造物果何如，往往形吉梦。\n天其助我心，勿使汝放纵。\n业贵精于勤，耐取晓窗冻。\n文章实公器，妙语世人共。\n岁朝哦此诗，洗盏揭春瓮。\n吾家有阴德，行矣光炎宋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40396,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高斋桂窟","author":"洪梦炎","text":"植桂不在多，种德如种树。\n前人能种后人传，自有清阴满庭户。\n高枝淩云低覆阑，晴光翠色生昼寒。\n人家多爱种桃李，几日春风红满地。\n何如此花开独迟，蟾宫窟里秋香细。\n课儿读书书满床，更将幽兴引壶觞。\n半酣独卧高斋下，啼鸟数声清昼长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40397,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟泊港口","author":"洪渐","text":"月浸芦花水漫天，渔翁醉后正堪眠。\n夜深何处孤猿咽，不管江边有客船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40398,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送新知永州陈秘丞瞻赴任","author":"洪湛","text":"零陵古郡枕湘川，太守南归得意年。\n茶味欲过衡岳寺，橘香先上洞庭船。\n锦衣照耀维桑地，石燕翻飞欲雨天。\n若到浯溪须舣棹，次山遗颂想依然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40399,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈希夷","author":"洪湛","text":"华山高万丈，莲峰映初日。\n中有希夷子，默坐养神谧。\n芝朮无外求，巢由乃共匹。\n形迹任化迁，元枢守贞一。\n望岫群息心，清谈讵能悉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40400,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发池潭至卢沟河","author":"洪皓","text":"燕山除馆俯池潭，踰月羁孤苦吏贪。\n摇望卢河一舍阻，著鞭信宿次关南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40401,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石碏大义灭亲","author":"洪皓","text":"恶吁及厚笃忠纯，大义无私遂灭亲。\n后代奸邪残骨肉，屡援斯语陷良臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40402,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再寄 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"馆阁飞声彊仕年，胸中藻思若云骞。\n驽骀失主无光彩，遐想骐驎受玉鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40403,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再寄 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"樽酒摇期共细倾，孙郎假道莫贪程。\n科名虽已追何仅，隐语尤当继子荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40404,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再寄孙文 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"见危讵敢惜馀年，若欲全生义则骞。\n久困盐车思仰首，如蒙赠策胜金鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40405,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再寄孙文 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"中原分裂似天倾，公带群英世作程。\n我坐儒冠稽复命，王郎代匮已之荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40406,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次李通奉韵见招 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"未税南冠为有身，忘形尔汝见情亲。\n我诗速客酬嘉节，倾盖从前有几人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40407,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次李通奉韵见招 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"万里流离只一身，东西南北与谁亲。\n登高且伴高僧话，揖孟怀陶任世人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40408,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次彦深韵 其三","author":"洪皓","text":"祝寿开樽象乐和，傞傞态度屡婆娑。\n动容咏德终宵乐，从此修文定止戈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40409,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次彦深韵 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"虽遇严冬喜气和，开筵出妓骋婆娑。\n折腰翘袖为公寿，愿赞监军早戢戈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40410,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次彦深韵 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"日长漏永滴铜壶，酒冽杯深困腐儒。\n公子殷勤歌舞劝，献酬交错屡传呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40411,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵春日即事六首 其六","author":"洪皓","text":"禁烟未睹燕子飞，料峭寒生透寝衣。\n欲去踟蹰情味恶，春归底事不同归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40412,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵春日即事六首 其五","author":"洪皓","text":"何须百鸟献花红，懒似吾师有祖风。\n儒释自来曾结社，不妨俱隐小堂中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40413,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵春日即事六首 其四","author":"洪皓","text":"如膏细雨沐轻红，更有催花少女风。\n薄暮浓云横汉外，西山数点有无中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40414,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵春日即事六首 其三","author":"洪皓","text":"恨无六翮不能飞，一见慈颜戏彩衣。\n跃马问鞍惊被执，式微空赋未容归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40415,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵春日即事六首 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"远访夭桃映面红，俯临寒食困和风。\n幽燕在昔多佳丽，应有留题外户中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40416,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵春日即事六首 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"暮春百卉未舒红，尽日寻芳溯晚风。\n谁道倦游鞍马上，且投佳句锦囊中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40417,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过曹溪 其三","author":"洪皓","text":"半世囚拘愧牧羊，生还四载却投荒。\n危机未履已如此，欲效前贤问上苍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40418,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过曹溪 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"一宿南华暂息机，未知五十九年非。\n应身虽在问无应，漫上层楼看信衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40419,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过曹溪 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"六十之年入瘴乡，灵台未了热非常。\n锡泉一饮根尘净，重到清凉礼梵王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40420,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀母","author":"洪皓","text":"行年已是老衰秋，复命稽迟为絷留。\n恋主思亲归未得，梦魂长绕大江头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40421,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邺都","author":"洪皓","text":"流离万里偶生还，暂得安阳一日闲。\n飞盖曳裾何处去，西园不见见青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40422,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念母","author":"洪皓","text":"复命无由责在身，可堪甘旨误慈亲。\n飘零殊异三年宦，遗肉知存愧饿人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40423,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"垂翅东隅四五年，不知何日遂鸿鶱。\n传书燕足徒虚语，强学山公醉举鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40424,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"缓颊难支大厦倾，单车久税阻归程。\n慈颜万里音书绝，忍看东风动紫荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40425,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"药名一绝","author":"洪皓","text":"独活他乡已九秋，刚肠续断更淹留。\n宁知老母相思子，没药医治白尽头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40426,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"都亭驿诗","author":"洪皓","text":"都驿荒凉尚邃深，息肩藉庇有馀阴。\n故宫今已生禾黍，翻作行人倍痛心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40427,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄孙修撰顷尝同舍讶予多忘有见过之意 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"不挹风猷二十年，天涯沦落看腾骞。\n若无大故休遐弃，唁我何方早著鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40428,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄孙修撰顷尝同舍讶予多忘有见过之意 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"未见古人心已倾，扬鞭何惜一朝程。\n自惭病忘非多忘，傥逐班荆即负荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40429,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范郎中 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"相门有相未多年，德行双全亚子骞。\n匪晚南归施有政，也应示辱用蒲鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40430,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范郎中 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"才闻家世便心倾，何况通经古是程。\n范叔青云能自致，不须河朔寄柴荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40431,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望江南","author":"洪皓","text":"登高引领望江南，家在江南杳霭间。\n满目烽烟归路远，萱亲不见泪潸潸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40432,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"愆期 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"日长岑寂度如年，然诺胡为我辈骞。\n渐入清和宜枉驾，坐邀勿讶亟挥鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40433,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"愆期 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"久留家酿待公倾，引领东望屡问程。\n新作小亭堪小宴，几时低唱进南荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40434,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题苏公济所居","author":"洪皓","text":"山绕孤村水绕家，传经载酒有侯芭。\n眼前十亩无多地，只种桑榆不种花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40435,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵知德所居","author":"洪皓","text":"黄柑压树酒浮蚁，红叶满林梅放花。\n三叠青山老竹杖，十年明月故人家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40436,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题谭秀才所居","author":"洪皓","text":"眼见云林百虑消，人间静处即云霄。\n时时醉卧听流水，低拂垂杨欠小桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40437,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠彦清 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"门下栖迟近一年，郎君高义薄云天。\n傥能一语宁三国，应有嘉名万古传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40438,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小亭落成都官有诗次韵以谢 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"小亭偪仄仅容身，开宴添樽有主人。\n爽垲何妨当九夏，芳菲可惜过三春。\n休嗟芍药随风陨，待看葵花向日新。\n万里远来逢一饱，粗胜夫子厄于陈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40439,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小亭落成都官有诗次韵以谢 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"我被儒冠误此身，公缘何事作流人。\n琼葩乍折香胜雪，玉版初尝暖似春。\n月桂他年应独折，琼林今日遂重新。\n披襟散发无妨醉，况有红妆二八陈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40440,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山顶花","author":"洪皓","text":"万片随风正可嗟，残枝带雨认梨花。\n胭脂洗尽馀香雪，翠幄光生散绮霞。\n品类海棠无杰句，方言山顶更雄誇。\n题诗载酒同清赏，月上梢头始到家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40441,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日有感","author":"洪皓","text":"不见朝正秖自愁，展亲弗逮兖州囚。\n席重摇忆谈经会，酒噀宁知救火谋。\n内热空持白羽扇，峭寒且著黑羔裘。\n履端醽醁何时赐，落笔高歌洒泪休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40442,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"车行大雨中","author":"洪皓","text":"折巾咨暑雨，持节栉回风。\n马惜障泥锦，农披护背篷。\n摧轮方臲卼，痛仆且牢笼。\n涂曲休辞辱，行将与夏通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40443,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用韵赠傅学士兼述怀思古 其三","author":"洪皓","text":"欲话艰难虑损神，可怜无告一穷民。\n诙谐好比卢思道，喜怒忘同杜子春。\n去国登楼聊自遣，越乡怀璧不如贫。\n范雎为魏归须贾，不是绨袍恋故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40444,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用韵赠傅学士兼述怀思古 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"新诗警策速如神，又见关中出舜民。\n正是稠云方积雪，俄蒙摛藻便为春。\n蜂拥鹤膝音虽婉，金埒铜山句未贫。\n故将风骚方入选，少卿同是陇西人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40445,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春有感","author":"洪皓","text":"强拟登台豁旅愁，五行今日到金囚。\n土牛始正农祥候，綵胜初衔鬼隐谋。\n司启空传青鸟氏，迎春不见翠云裘。\n一卮寿酒何缘受，觅纸题诗死不休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40446,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次观表文韵 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"求成虐执四三年，一木难支大厦颠。\n致死存孤思杵臼，恃强轻敌笑苻坚。\n国家未免中衰者，日月何妨薄食焉。\n今日一成终祀夏，艰难启圣赖皇天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40447,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次观表文韵 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"岁云暮矣厌三馀，岂不怀归畏简书。\n昔日卑辞刚不听，今冬继请谅难虚。\n贾生施饵非良策，陈子哦诗或起予。\n江左四年无信息，欲传尺素羡双鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40448,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次雨中暖房韵","author":"洪皓","text":"首夏霖淫似早秋，坐邀车马愧无由。\n提壶见就倾三爵，具馔何尝选百羞。\n刚道暖房排旅闷，实图求友慰幽囚。\n言归倒载冲泥怯，继捧新诗胜赵讴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40449,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次信文早春韵 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"一星终后尚蹉跎，四壁如悬已化梭。\n方殢圣贤排旅闷，忽惊天地应人和。\n春风乍扇融冰雪，佛火初收散绮罗。\n遐想故园桃李下，旧蹊好在有谁过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40450,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次信文早春韵 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"丘壑幽怀日已蹉，宁论邻女戏投梭。\n干戈未戢贪修怨，玉帛还留误讲和。\n恩许养痾徒受粟，老来便静任张罗。\n春回又起江湖念，愿致山翁一叶过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40451,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次种野花韵诗","author":"洪皓","text":"强移野卉对残春，深恐焦枯向日薰。\n种止一行非贵少，高才三寸岂超群。\n既无艳色堪观赏，又乏幽香漫吐芬。\n却忆故园都谢了，卖花声断几时闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40452,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次赵民瞻韵","author":"洪皓","text":"假馆连墙数见过，宗英年少隽才多。\n设科不倦来群彦，教学无他伏众魔。\n草赋未曾师屈宋，哦诗岂复慕阴何。\n后生可畏吾将老，终养心违愧蓼莪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40453,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次谒茶假寐之句","author":"洪皓","text":"僻陋虽无车马喧，支颐时复抱愁眠。\n我思蝶梦为园吏，君继云封作地仙。\n茶盌捧来休怨后，诗坛哦罢敢争先。\n形如槁木追南郭，隐几何妨效嗒然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40454,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次督洗泥韵","author":"洪皓","text":"阴山趺坐匪逃秦，杖锡聊充观国宾。\n君已无家携爱子，我虽有室别慈亲。\n顷年共试同文馆，今日俱为异域人。\n千里远来当洗拂，松醪未熟且休嗔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40455,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵同出祓殡","author":"洪皓","text":"弭节于今涉四年，扬鞭同出岂徒然。\n临丧弗用先桃茢，跃马宁思惜锦鞯。\n勿讶廉颇羞蔺下，自知杨炯愧卢前。\n归来病体殊饥倦，亟遣庖人起爨烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40456,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宇文白云山 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"天际正英英，排空忽上升。\n苍梧何处出，岱岳自封兴。\n但见奇峰耸，宁知嘉气凝。\n秋风殊未起，勿用遽飞腾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40457,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宇文赠赵宿州","author":"洪皓","text":"尹京便可继翁归，暂向符离一把麾。\n善抚新边千里肃，复还旧治九重知。\n策勋久矣推多算，琢句飘然泯小疵。\n三事古由高第入，才兼二器莫忧迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40458,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵朱少章潭园马上口占 其一","author":"洪皓","text":"燕国由来士女都，家家行乐集城隅。\n岂无鱼鸟如灵沼，若有莼鲈似太湖。\n我絷南冠尝独到，君邀北使欲相呼。\n驱车宵济卢河去，十里荷花待入吴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40459,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵朱少章潭园马上口占 其二","author":"洪皓","text":"幽都风俗慕成都，可待遨头指路隅。\n杨柳垂阴连北道，芙蕖舒艳亚西湖。\n客思剧饮逃三伏，人患苛留阻一呼。\n回首未忘忧墨吏，渡江应不怕天吴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40460,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵夜闻鹅鸭声二物自淮甸至","author":"洪皓","text":"传闻二物出三洲，万里笼来地僻幽。\n岂为写经求厚味，且图牵眼逐轻沤。\n眠沙若得房公馈，见弹须防陆子谋。\n已戒儿童莫相恼，比邻容得夜鸣不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40461,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵学士重阳雪中见招不赴前后十六首 其十六","author":"洪皓","text":"胸中耿耿向谁陈，舌在形羸强集神。\n佩印已惭苏季子，埋名谁志李元宾。\n乞粮傥死呼庚癸，贵格何须足乙辛。\n秪恐数穷为鬼录，扁舟阻泛五湖春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40462,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵学士重阳雪中见招不赴前后十六首 其十五","author":"洪皓","text":"咫尺书来弗获陈，深虞衅鼓祃于神。\n行人久执缘何罪，凡伯还归为弗宾。\n聘鲁未能希季札，奔齐安敢效先辛。\n或行或止关天命，岂是臧仓沮子春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40463,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵学士重阳雪中见招不赴前后十六首 其十四","author":"洪皓","text":"公干沉绵自懒陈，黄能入梦是何神。\n眼前散帙看盈几，肘后名方或问宾。\n衾枕频移滋转困，盘餐少异强加辛。\n小人有母何时见，梦系江南戏綵春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40464,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵学士重阳雪中见招不赴前后十六首 其十三","author":"洪皓","text":"韦编懒读厌窥陈，习气难除但耗神。\n岂敢为师同颖士，从初作吏慕君宾。\n数奇尝遇辰冲戍，运背难逢丙合辛。\n居士于今称耐辱，天边斗柄又移春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":40465,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]